1
00:00:00,679 --> 00:00:02,349
(Sheldon:)I also have the other kind
of will,

2
00:00:02,347 --> 00:00:06,547
(Sheldon:)and in it I will my Wil
back to Wil.

3
00:00:06,552 --> 00:00:07,522
(Leonard:)Will Wil want it?

4
00:00:07,519 --> 00:00:08,949
(Wil:)Wil won't.

5
00:00:09,621 --> 00:00:11,321
(Penny:)What's that ring box?

6
00:00:11,323 --> 00:00:12,393
(Sheldon:)Oh. That is

7
00:00:12,391 --> 00:00:13,691
(Sheldon:)an engagement ring

8
00:00:13,692 --> 00:00:15,892
(Sheldon:)that I was going to give
my girlfriend Amy.

9
00:00:15,894 --> 00:00:17,694
What?!

10
00:00:19,198 --> 00:00:20,828
(Leonard:)You bought her a ring?

11
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:21,863
No, no, no. This has been
in my family

12
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:24,867
(Sheldon:)for generations.
Except for a short time

13
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:27,340
(Sheldon:)when Comanches cut off my
great-great-great-grandmother's

14
00:00:27,339 --> 00:00:29,509
(Sheldon:)finger and stole it.

15
00:00:29,922 --> 00:00:31,752
(Wil:)Sheldon, that's awful.
No.

16
00:00:31,757 --> 00:00:33,957
(Sheldon:)The Texas Rangers tracked them
down to their village

17
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:35,629
(Sheldon:)and slaughtered
every last one of them, so...

18
00:00:35,628 --> 00:00:38,928
(Sheldon:)it was a happy ending.

19
00:00:38,931 --> 00:00:42,231
(Sheldon:)Well, for my nine-fingered Nana.

20
00:00:42,234 --> 00:00:45,064
(Penny:)Okay, back to the ring.
Does Amy even know about this?

21
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:48,270
(Sheldon:)No. She broke up with me before
I could broach the subject.

22
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:50,804
(Leonard:)Oh, man, I'm sorry...
that must have been devastating for you.

23
00:00:50,809 --> 00:00:52,309
(Sheldon:)No, not at all.
No, I'm fine.

24
00:00:52,311 --> 00:00:54,581
(Sheldon:)You know, Amy had reservations
about our relationship,

25
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,250
(Sheldon:)so all worked out
for the best.

26
00:00:56,248 --> 00:01:04,028
PENNY: I know. It just...
SHELDON: I said I'm fine!

